  "details": "If you haven't already heard, VRChat is implementing a EAC Easy Anti Cheat in their game. As a result, you won't be able to use ANY mods, malicious or not, including anti-crashers. If you have a VRC+, I advise cancelling it and not opening VRChat for at least a week in order to create a noticeable player drop. Please think about urging your friends to follow. You are not allowed to use anti-crash modifications. You are unable to use any of the other mod features you have grown to love. You aren't allowed to use secure, open-source mods that have never ruined anyone's gaming experience. Please help by upvoteing these links! <3 Have a good night/day everyone!\nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/3f20I3nQsYDV980FMzsPQx?si=82c8a5019e6c4a15\nhttps://hello.vrchat.com/blog/vrchat-security-update\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/eac-in-a-social-vr-game-creates-more-problems-than-it-solves\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1212-eac-disproportionately-punishes-deaf-and-hard-of-hearing-users\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/do-not-pass-this-we-need-wholesome-modding\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/please-dont-ban-mods-use-them-for-the-better-and-maybe-give-the-modifications-to\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1212-stop-eac",
